    "section": "",
    "text": "This website is my personal interactive econometrics textbook, developed alongside my Master’s workshops and lectures at École Polytechnique.\nIts purpose is to consolidate theoretical concepts, mathematical derivations, tutorial exercises, and computational applications in R into a structured resource for long-term learning.",
    "crumbs": [
      "Econometrics — M1"
    ]
  },
