  {
    "objectID": "index.html#course-structure",
    "href": "index.html#course-structure",
    "title": "Econometrics — M1",
    "section": "Course Structure",
    "text": "Course Structure\nThe course is organised into eight classes.\nEach class contains:\n\nTheory & Intuition: Key concepts and explanations.\nMathematical Derivations: Important proofs and results.\nTutorial Exercises: Practice problems with detailed solutions, including simulations and econometric implementations, with R applications.",
    "crumbs": [
      "Econometrics — M1"
    ]
  },
  {
    "objectID": "index.html#learning-objectives",
    "href": "index.html#learning-objectives",
    "title": "Econometrics — M1",
    "section": "Learning Objectives",
    "text": "Learning Objectives\nThe goal is to understand their mathematical foundations, interpret their results, and recognize when they can be applied.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nNoteHow to use this website\n\n\n\nNavigate through the classes using the sidebar.\nTry solving the exercises before revealing their solutions, and use the R applications to explore the theoretical results.",
    "crumbs": [
      "Econometrics — M1"
